    "group": "Warpbane Task Force",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Opponent’s Movement Phase. As it begins, choose a GREY KNIGHTS INFANTRY unit of yours. For that phase, roll a D6 each time a foe is placed on the battlefield within 6″ of your chosen unit or ends a move that close. The trigger covers Normal moves, Advance moves and Fall Back moves. If your Hallowed Ground contains the whole chosen unit, increase the result by 2. A result of 4+ inflicts D3 mortal wounds on the triggering unit.",
